\newlabel{tab:online}{{5}{15}{Online non-stationary CIFAR-10 TTA ($3$ seeds/regime). Always-adapt collapses in the harm regime; always-freeze forgoes gains in the helpful regime; \textsc {KGA} is near-best in both and has the highest mean across regimes. Harm-regime std: freeze $0.009$, adapt $0.025$, KGA $0.009$}{table.5}{}}
