\newlabel{fig:c10c}{{10}{17}{CIFAR-10-C. Left: severity-5 accuracy by corruption---online Tent and \textsc {KGA} both recover the frozen baseline (no per-corruption collapse). Right: knowability crossover map---adaptation headroom (oracle gain over freeze) by corruption $\times $ severity; large on noise/blur, small on easy corruptions (brightness), matching where $\Delta $ is large}{figure.10}{}}
